## Messages shown to Pacified players when they try to do violence:

# With projectiles:
pacified-cannot-throw = 我實在不忍心把 { THE($projectile) } 扔出去，那可能會傷到人！
# With embedding projectiles:
pacified-cannot-throw-embed = 我絕對不可能扔 { THE($projectile) }，那東西可能會卡在別人體內啊！
# With liquid-spilling projectiles:
pacified-cannot-throw-spill = 我絕對不能把 { THE($projectile) } 扔出去，那可能會把髒東西潑到別人身上！
pacified-cannot-harm-directly = 我實在不忍心傷害 { THE($entity) }！
pacified-cannot-harm-indirect = 我不能破壞 { THE($entity) }，這可能會傷到人！
pacified-cannot-fire-gun = 我不能開火 { THE($entity) }，這可能會傷到人！
